{"text": "AURIA MCALICHER\n\nPROFILE\n27 yeers of experience in audio visual production, both live and broadcast, with @ primary\nfocus of serving presidential level events. Experience working many high end events and\ncontracts through WHCA, RNC, 2005 Inauguration and many republicen presidential\n\ncandidates during election cycles.\n\nEXPERIENCE\n\nWAGTEC INC. SILVER SPRING, MD ~ 1989-1992,\nProduction lead and audio engineer (Az)\nALL STAGE AN! AYTONSVILLE, MD 1992-1994\nAV assistant manager.\nNATIONAL PUBLIC RADIO. WASHINGTON DC 1994-1998\nAudio engineer, Master control technician\n\nFCA TECHNOLOGIES. ROHRERSVILLE, MD ~ 1996- TO PRESENT\nSole proprietor, consultant. Offering audio engineering, technical director, event\nmanagement to many national and international event companies.\n\nEVENT STRATEGIES INC. ALEXANDRIA, VA \u2014 2000- TO PRESENT\nActing Technical Director.\n\nDONALD TRUMP FOR PRESIDENT 2016 TO 2017\n\nDirector of Production\n\ne\nDirector of Production\n\nNTIAL INAUGURAL COMMITTEE 2016 TO PRE:\n\nEDUCATION\nPERRYHALL HIGH. PERRYHALL, MD 1986\nGOUCHER COLLEGE. TOWSON, MD - 1998\nEASTMAN CONSERVATORY. ROCHESTER, NY 1989",
